<title>NORWAY: Dyno H197 operating result per division.</title>
<headline>Dyno H197 operating result per division.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Operating profits by division at Norwegian explosives and chemicals company Dyno Industrier ASA for the six months to June 30.</p>
<p>			  (millions of crowns unless stated)</p>
<p>   Explosives		171	  vs	  125</p>
<p>   Chemicals		 166	  vs	  108</p>
<p>   Plastics		   29	  vs	   51</p>
<p>   Particles		   0	  vs	    2</p>
<p>   Other	     minus  66	  vs   minus 42</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
